          "block_content": " $$ \\begin{aligned}\\binom{\\alpha}{n}-\\binom{\\alpha-1}{n}&=\\frac{1}{n!}\\alpha(\\alpha-1)(\\alpha-2)\\cdots(\\alpha-n+1)\\\\&\\quad-\\frac{1}{n!}(\\alpha-1)(\\alpha-2)\\cdots(\\alpha-n)\\\\&=\\frac{1}{n!}(\\alpha-1)(\\alpha-2)\\cdots(\\alpha-n+1)(\\alpha-(\\alpha-n))\\\\&=\\frac{1}{(n-1)!}(\\alpha-1)(\\alpha-2)\\cdots(\\alpha-n+1)\\\\&=\\binom{\\alpha-1}{n-1}.\\end{aligned} $$ ",
